  "body": "Security fixes:\r\n\r\n* Prevent a compromised or malicious app/runtime/extension with extra-data\r\n  from creating setuid root files on the host system when installed\r\n  (CVE-2026-133842, [GHSA-p4mw-6jfq-r82r](https://github.com/flatpak/flatpak/security/advisories/GHSA-p4mw-6jfq-r82r); thanks to RoyalOughtness)\r\n\r\n* Prevent a compromised or malicious app from escaping the sandbox by\r\n  manipulating file descriptor passing via flatpak-portal\r\n  (CVE-2026-133845, [GHSA-5jrj-948r-2wx6](https://github.com/flatpak/flatpak/security/advisories/GHSA-5jrj-948r-2wx6); thanks to refi64)\r\n\r\nOther bug fixes:\r\n\r\n* Fix a regression in the CI release workflow now that Ubuntu 26.04\r\n  is the default",
